OL,3,CGames has shown Scotland at its best,
OL,4,Csays Swinney ahead of closing ceremony
OL,6,FThe Commonwealth Games has "shown
OL,7,FScotland at its very best", First
OL,8,FMinister John Swinney has said ahead
OL,9,Fof the event's closing ceremony.
OL,11,FThe 11-day sporting extravaganza will
OL,12,Fcome to an end on Sunday evening,
OL,13,Fafter more than 3,000 athletes flocked
OL,14,Fto Glasgow from 74 different nations
OL,15,Fand territories.
OL,17,FThe closing ceremony will celebrate
OL,18,Fthe Indian city of Amdavad, which will
OL,19,Fhost the 2030 Commonwealth Games.
OL,26,@nD@\OUoD@ZO]
