OL,3,CGames has shown Scotland at its best,
OL,4,Csays Swinney ahead of closing ceremony
OL,6,FThe handover segment will involve some
OL,7,Fof India's biggest musical and dancing
OL,8,Ftalent.
OL,10,FGlasgow stepped in to host the current
OL,11,FGames after the Australian state of
OL,12,FVictoria pulled out, citing spiralling
OL,13,Fcosts.
OL,15,FThe First Minister said: "The success
OL,16,Fof the Glasgow 2026 Commonwealth Games
OL,17,Fhas shown Scotland at its very best.
OL,26,@wD@ZOU
