OL,3,CGames has shown Scotland at its best,
OL,4,Csays Swinney ahead of closing ceremony
OL,6,F"We have welcomed athletes and
OL,7,Fsupporters from the 74 nations and
OL,8,Fcome together in an outstanding
OL,9,Fcelebration of sport and diversity.
OL,11,F"We have enjoyed watching athletes
OL,12,Fcompeting at the highest level,
OL,13,Fbreaking records and inspiring many of
OL,14,Fus to take part in sporting activities
OL,15,Fourselves."
OL,17,FMr Swinney said the Games would leave
OL,18,Fa legacy of improved sporting
OL,19,Ffacilities, including at the
OL,20,Fgrassroots level.
OL,26,@nD@AOUsD@AOUwD@KO]
