OL,3,CGames has shown Scotland at its best,
OL,4,Csays Swinney ahead of closing ceremony
OL,6,FHe added: "People who have travelled
OL,7,Fto Scotland for the Games have
OL,8,Fexperienced our world-class
OL,9,Fhospitality, which has been an
OL,10,Fexcellent boost for our tourism sector
OL,11,Fand wider economy.
OL,13,F"It was only possible with Glasgow
OL,14,Fstepping in at short notice that we've
OL,15,Fbeen able to protect this special
OL,16,Fevent.
OL,26,@nD@KOUuD@AOU
