OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F310A1785685703
OL,3,CGames has shown Scotland at its best,
OL,4,Csays Swinney ahead of closing ceremony
OL,6,F"The reimagined model of these Games
OL,7,Fwill help them continue into the
OL,8,Ffuture, creating hosting opportunities
OL,9,Ffor other Commonwealth countries `
OL,10,Fwith a focus on inclusivity and
OL,11,Finnovative approaches to reduce the
OL,12,Fenvironmental impact."
OL,14,FUK Government Minister for Scotland
OL,15,FMelanie Ward praised the volunteers `
OL,16,Fknown as the Glasgow 2026 Legends `
OL,17,Fwho had made the Games possible.
OL,26,@nD@AOUtD@VO]
