OL,3,CGames has shown Scotland at its best,
OL,4,Csays Swinney ahead of closing ceremony
OL,6,FShe said: "As the Commonwealth Games
OL,7,Fdraw to a close, I'd like to say a
OL,8,Fhuge congratulations to all the
OL,9,Fcompetitors and medallists who have
OL,10,Fmade it an unforgettable showcase of
OL,11,Fworld-class sporting talent.
OL,13,F"Once again, Glasgow has shone under
OL,14,Fthe spotlight and demonstrated it is
OL,15,Famong the top places to host world
OL,16,Fsporting events.
OL,26,@nD@KOUuD@AOU
