OL,3,CGames has shown Scotland at its best,
OL,4,Csays Swinney ahead of closing ceremony
OL,6,F"Seeing the city spring into action to
OL,7,Fsave the 2026 Games less than two
OL,8,Fyears ago, and then deliver a 11-day
OL,9,Fspectacle building on the legacy of
OL,10,Fthe celebrated 2014 games, has made me
OL,11,Fincredibly proud."
